#: 3e683a942d114ce1b69fe9917661a013
msgid "C++ console interface"
msgstr "C++ 控制台接口"

#: a4c296de0b514e23b88e14f229e844cd
msgid ""
"The console interface embeds Jittor's Python runtime in a C++17 program. Its"
" array bridge avoids an extra Python-level copy when moving typed C++ arrays"
" into Jittor operations."
msgstr "控制台接口把计图的 Python 运行时嵌入 C++17 程序。它的数组桥接在把有类型的 C++ 数组送入计图算子时避免了额外的 Python 层拷贝。"

#: 0a3add4237634c83a0e30c23395fca1d
msgid "Generate and compile the example"
msgstr "生成并编译示例"

#: 2380d95df83c47a1a40e0dec2d0b6752
msgid "Use the active Python interpreter for both configuration commands:"
msgstr "两条配置命令都应使用当前 Python 解释器："

#: 5bba0236026d41cf820c4a470f740189
msgid ""
"The generated source includes the console header and initializes one "
"embedded runtime:"
msgstr "生成的源文件会包含控制台头文件，并初始化一个嵌入式运行时："

#: 8a11ceb9a57e45f0839eee20597bb813
msgid "Flush Python output when it is interleaved with C++ streams."
msgstr "当 Python 输出与 C++ 流交错时，请刷新 Python 输出。"

#: 59aff6c47a854aa4a951dde2bd2f782b
msgid "Exchange scalar and container values"
msgstr "交换标量与容器值"

#: fe4e566f6abc46019e6d7d05fe67ee60
msgid "`set<T>` and `get<T>` exchange named values with the embedded namespace:"
msgstr "`set<T>` 和 `get<T>` 用于与嵌入式命名空间交换具名值："

#: 85bf976f8eb1474a96fb4a66e4d08b49
msgid ""
"Supported families include integer and floating-point scalars, strings, "
"vectors, maps, and unordered maps."
msgstr "支持的类型包括整数和浮点标量、字符串、向量、映射以及无序映射。"

#: b5e4d0e33a334dffb6139e68b3065c34
msgid "Exchange Jittor arrays"
msgstr "交换计图数组"

#: b4f9eb48e4464be8af2b9f540a1cd3cd
msgid "`jittor::array<T, N>` records a fixed rank, shape, and owned data buffer:"
msgstr "`jittor::array<T, N>` 记录固定的秩、形状和自有数据缓冲区："

#: f1cd058312c040eda07474e68d251083
msgid ""
"The requested type and rank in `get_array<T, N>` must match the value in the"
" console namespace. The array interface provides `shape`, `data`, `size()`, "
"`nbyte()`, `dtype()`, `ndim()`, and indexed element access."
msgstr ""
"`get_array<T, N>` 请求的类型和秩必须与控制台命名空间中的值一致。数组接口提供 "
"`shape`、`data`、`size()`、`nbyte()`、`dtype()`、`ndim()` 和按下标访问元素的能力。"

#: 227a060f84f14e7a872784d06774c9ff
msgid "Run a model"
msgstr "运行模型"

#: 621bcfa1a3b541fe932925f77d50a18a
msgid "Arrays can be inputs to normal Python model code:"
msgstr "数组可以作为普通 Python 模型代码的输入："

#: ce33138c73884ed29f83f0dbb942248f
msgid ""
"Keep one `Console` instance for related calls. Repeatedly creating embedded "
"interpreters defeats compilation-cache reuse and complicates Python runtime "
"lifetime management."
msgstr "相关调用应复用同一个 `Console` 实例。反复创建嵌入式解释器会失去编译缓存复用，并使 Python 运行时的生命周期管理更复杂。"
